1146: SLPI stage 3: answer the SLPI's other GLINK channels. Boot 32 showed the SLPI opening "fastrpcglink-apps-dsp" (id 1), "glink_ssr" (2),
"IPCRTR" (3) and "LOOPBACK_CTL_DSPS" (4); only IPCRTR was acknowledged, and its sensor_process then died after 40 s with "USER-PD DOG
detects stalled initialization". glink_edge gets an optional hook (ge->hook, NULL for the modem, one `if` in ipc_rx_poll) that sees every
command first; for the SLPI edge sl_gx_hook claims the fastrpc and glink_ssr channels (open-ack, our open, intents, data reassembly,
close, RX_INTENT_REQ, a send queue for later) and leaves everything else to the generic code. Received data on them is logged as hex.
No FastRPC logic yet (1148). Requires 1141/1142.

